{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And when a priest acquires a soul.</b> A Canaanite slave acquired for his body." "<b>And one born in his house.</b> These are the children of the maidservants; and a priest's wife eats terumah from this verse — for she too is his monetary acquisition, and furthermore it is learned from another verse (Numbers 18), ״כָּל טָהוֹר בְּבֵיתְךָ״ and so on — in the Sifrei."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:41.422831522Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}